    {
      "is": "IS 2676:1981",
      "clause": "3.2",
      "title": "Squareness Tolerances for Sheets",
      "text": "3.2 Squareness Tolerances for Sheets -  The  difference of the two diagonal distances between opposite corners of any sheet shall not exceed the total tolerance of the sheet, that is, sum of positive and negative tolerance. For detailed information, refer to IS  2676 : 1981 Specifications for dimensions for wrought aluminium and aluminium alloys, sheet and strip (first revision).",
